      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Maiden's Eye [ToL]\n**Who:**\n- The Great Hero Ezra - ToL [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 115\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Bundle of Maiden's Eye Books [item=142909]\n- History of the Eye [item=142908]\n- Nightmare Enchanter Diary [item=142907]\n- Nightmare Purba [item=142910]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Atulinae Xi Ial [npc=56905]\n- Diabo Xi Xakreum [npc=56871]\n- a manifested nightmare [npc=57123]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of Maiden's Eye (10 Points) [quest=10570]\n**Era:** | !Terror of Luclin\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 17 12:15:09 2021\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Terror of Luclin Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nPrerequiste: Gone, And Can't Be Forgotten [quest=10496].\nYou say, 'Hail, The Great Hero Ezra'\nThe Great Hero Ezra says, 'You! You only have two arms and are not stupid! That's almost EXACTLY what it is I need to get to the bottom of this [conspiracy].'\nYou say, 'What conspiracy?'\nThe Great Hero Ezra narrows her eyes, giving a fierce, scrutinizing look at you, 'Don't act like you don't already know! I've seen you wandering around this place clueless.' Ezra's eyes water as she snorts before saying, 'It wasn't too long ago that I, too, was a clueless mess, only to be mocked at when I wasn't looking by better adventurers...' She wipes the tears from her eyes. 'But no more! Today I will teach you how to rise up to be the [champion] you were meant to be!'\nYou say, 'Wait, I'm not here to be a champion...'\nThe Great Hero Ezra's face lights up as any suspicion she may have had about your intentions fades from her mind. 'That's the spirit! Let's be heroes together! But first, this conspiracy you brought up. Since I've been here, I feel like I'm being watched. Something or someone is trying to take control of Luclin and has been making some plays...or so I assume. Truth be told I have no idea what is going on here, but I'm glad your [curiosity] will help get to the bottom of this.'\nYou say, 'I'm sorry, MY curiosity?'\nThe Great Hero Ezra says, 'Exactly! You see, I need someone to look into what could be trying to claw its way out of this moon. I could swear that if you put your ear to the ground, you can hear it snarling and [scratching] its way out!'\nYou say, 'What scratching?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'What Dreams May Yet Come?'.\nThe Great Hero Ezra says, 'Bah! What do you know, you don't have a hero's ears! You don't have a hero's eyes! You don't have a hero's tongue! I bet you can't taste half the flavors only a hero can taste! But that's why I'm here, to whip you into shape! First thing I need you to do is get the courage to leave my side. The second thing I need you to do is investigate the outpost. There is a room within the main hall. This room has a bed in it, but the akhevans do not need sleep. This must be investigated! Work up the courage to go inside that room and figure out what it could be used for!'\nThe Great Hero Ezra has found herself within Maiden's Eye and deep within a plot to unveil whatever presence seems to be haunting this area of Luclin. She seems adamant that it has something to do with the bedroom within the Outpost in Maiden's Eye.\n\n---\n\n1\\. **Search the room for any clues 0/1 Maiden's Eye**\nThere is a bedchamber within the outpost in Maiden's Eye that has no business being there. Search for a clue within the room that might explain what it is used for.\nGo to the bedroom in the north building of the akhevan outpost.\nYou have been given: Nightmare Enchanter Diary [item=142907]\n2\\. **Return to Ezra and give her the diary 0/1 Maiden's Eye**\nThe Great Hero Ezra snatches the book out of your hands and stares at you as though to question your intelligence, 'This was it? This was all you found?' she holds the book open vertically, in a way indicating to you that she does not handle books often, 'There aren't even any pictures in it! Oh well. This appears to be important, but I don't know how important. I bet there is another place where books are kept that could contain one, we need.' Ezra thinks for a moment before snapping her fingers. 'The library!' she exclaims, as if you will know what to say next, yet you do not. She then looks slightly annoyed, 'The library under the outpost, go there and see if you can find any history books or something, bring that back here.'\n3\\. **Search the library for any information about the history of the Maiden's Eye 0/1 Maiden's Eye**\nThe library underneath the outpost could hold clues as to what is happening within the bedchamber. You may find more information in there.\nGo to the basement of the west building in the akhevan outpost. Move around until ...\nYou have been given: History of the Eye [item=142908]\n4\\. **Return the history book to Ezra 0/1 Maiden's Eye**\nThe book you found has been badly damaged and large chunks of pages are missing. Ezra will want to see this.\nGo back to Ezra and give her the book.\nThe Great Hero Ezra scowls at you, 'You again? I'm surprised you showed your face around here after the last time you...' She has a sudden look of realization that you are not who she thought you were. 'I uh, apologize for that, ignore me. You found another book? So many books! I think this needs to be looked at by someone who actually likes books. Here, I put them in a nice neat little bundle for you, bring them to Atulinae Xi Ial [npc=56905] and see what they have to say about this.'\nYou have been given: Bundle of Maiden's Eye Books [item=142909]\n5\\. **Bring the bundle of books to Atulinae Xi Ial 0/1 Maiden's Eye**\nEzra has instructed you to bring the book to Atulinae Xi Ial, an akhevan priest found within the Maiden's Eye Camp. They will have a better understanding of what this all means.\nAtulinae Xi Ial is located in the hidden cave in the southeast corner. Give her the bundle.\nAtulinae Xi Ial looks you over as you approach with the books and before you could say anything, they say, 'Oh, I'm guessing Ezra sent you? She's a real treat! A little eccentric at times but her work is impeccable, you might learn something from her. She visited me a while back about some entity that she claimed was \"watching her.\" The diary you brought appears to be a dream diary of an [enchanter] who lived long ago.'\nYou say, 'Who was this enchanter?'\nAtulinae Xi Ial holds a book in each pair of hands, pausing to review them both before continuing, 'Unsure, but as you can see from this tome, we will not be getting much useful information out of it. However when cross referenced with the history book, it does explain a [few things].'\nYou say, ' What few things does it explain?'\nAtulinae Xi Ial closes both books with a flourish, 'You know how the akheva have been delving further into divinations? One of the methods they discovered was dream interpretations. However, because they have no need for sleeping, or dreaming, they found a way to forcefully enter dreams in order to interpret them as they are happening. However, they then discovered that within these dreams, they can take complete control of a being. The bed was a part of the ritual, the other part lies with Diabo Xi Xakreum [npc=56871]. You will want to locate them in the outpost, dispatch them, and retrieve the tool. I'm not sure what it exactly is, but it should be small, heavier than it seems, and easily concealed on a person. You will know what it is when you find [it]\nYou say, 'Once I find it, what should I do with it?'\nAtulinae Xi Ial says, 'Throw it into the primal torch found near the entrance to the Umbral Plains. This torch was built long ago for reasons lost to time and the enchanter manipulated the energies from the flame to their twisted will. It is said that they were able to use the energies to store a simulacrum of their soul inside of it. I believe this was an attempt at immortality that well...got what they wanted, I guess. The flame will cleanse the device, and the entity within will be no more. I believe their corruption is what is causing the divide from within the akheva.'\n6\\. **Find Diabo Xi Xakreum somewhere in the outpost and retrieve a device they have 0/1 Maiden's Eye**\nLocate Diabo Xi Xakreum within the outpost in Maiden's Eye. Kill them and retrieve an item that Atulinae Xi Ial is looking for.\nDiabo Xi Xakreum [npc=56871] is found is the east room of the southeast building in the akhevan outpost. Kill him and loot a Nightmare Purba [item=142910].\n7\\. **Bring the Nightmare Purba to the primal torch to be destroyed 0/1 Maiden's Eye**\nNow that you have the nightmare purba, bring it to the primal torch in Maiden's Eye.\n8\\. **Destroy the Manifested Nightmare 0/1 Maiden's Eye**\nKill a manifested nightmare [npc=57123].\n9\\. **Return to Atulinae Xi lal with your findings 0/1 Maiden's Eye**\nReturn to Atulinae Xi lal in the refugee camp to the southeast.\n10\\. **Return to The Great Hero Ezra 0/1 Maiden's Eye**\nReturn to The Great Hero Ezra and update her on what happened.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n354 platinum, 1 gold, 6 silver, 7 copper\nYou gain experience! (0.681% at level 116)\n**Submitted by:** Drewie",
